# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/draft-vocab four-card DEVELOPMENT window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/draft-vocab and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-dvocab-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head (sed -i 's/tp4-dvocab-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# S1 (the SAFE FIRST STEP on the cards): the timed arm's profile, c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-dvocab-parked, booted once with three tests: warmup, the steady eight-user shape (c2_smoke_check judges the eight-seat quad
# levers on it alone) and one coding answer. It proves, before any timing is spent, that the sliced head weight uploads at the attach inside the DRAM the smaller pool left, that the head and its one-chunk
# top-16 compile and run inside the parked draft traces and that the shortlist engaged: c2_smoke_check's draft-vocabulary rule (exactly one '[PINDIAG] draft vocab admitted', one 'head built' and one
# 'engaged' line, rows=40960 per_chip=10240 chips=4 topk_width=32768 and the three in that order) and every other rule clean, no stall. The head-built line names the dtype and the bytes a chip: RECORD
# them (the estimate assumes bfloat8_b, 56 MB; a bfloat16 head is 105 MB and the pool gave back 143 MB). A crash at the head build or the first draft pass (a DRAM allocation that fails, a top-16 or a
# linear that refuses the shape) ends the window's lever arms: read the container log's last 60 lines before anything else. Duration (estimate): 30 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-dvocab-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-dvocab-parked
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,concurrent8_steady,coding
C2_BOX_MINUTES=45
